  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Propyl alcohol&nbsp;undergo nucleophilic substitution reaction with thionyl chloride to give propyl chloride. Propyl chloride give butane nitrile on reaction with potasium cyanide. Butane nitrile on reduction give butyl amine.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ddb57688-e1a7-4b45-aeb4-26c994a1048d-3ae804f4-aeca-40e3-80ee-aec9125c09f9-image.png\" style=\"width: 469px; height: 147px;\" /></p>",
